      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Named after Italian explorer Henri de Tonti, the town’s early settlers arrived under Father Pietro Bandini’s guidance.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
